      transliteration: "Mutal aiyar oruvaṉ\nmuṉi taṉakku amayntavaṉ\nvital uṭaiyāṉ vēntaṉ\nvēlai nīr vaṇṇaṉ\nkatal arakkaṉ nagar kaṭṭaḻitta\nkaṇṇi am kaḻal\ntoṭara vallār toṇṭar\ntūmalar piṟavi toṭarntaṉarē.",
