      altTranslation: "The one primordial Lord who was given to the sage —\nthe sword-bearing king, the ocean-water-colored one:\nthose servants able to cling to the beautiful anklet-ornament\nof the one who destroyed the roaring demon's city —\nthey have continued in a birth of pure flowers.",
