      altTranslation: "We shall reach the sacred feet — come, O devotees!\nWe shall follow those who have conquered the five senses.\nAs the ancient Veda-sound flows across —\nlet us go to the archer who received the boon\nthat made Kauśalyā freely give him up.",
      theme: "A Call to Follow — Kulaśēkara steps out of the Kauśalyā persona momentarily to call fellow devotees to join him in following Rāma. Bhakti is communal.",
