      transliteration: "Paḷḷi eḻu mā malar\npātaṅkaḷ kaṇṭukoṇṭu\nkoḷḷi vāyk kākam pōl\nkumuṟum aṭiyavar\nveḷḷi veṇ tiṅkaḷ\nmati mukattāṉ vēlai kaṭait\npoḷḷal caṅkam ēnti\npoliyum pukaḻ pōṟṟuvēṉ.",
